    "text": "Nothing will be deleted\n\nYou cancelled request {requestId} to delete your Early Letters account. Nothing will be deleted.\n\nYour letters and books are back, for you and for your co-parent if you share a book.\n\nWelcome back to your book.\n\nOpen Early Letters {appUrl}\n\nDid not cancel this yourself? Reply to this email and we will help.\n\nWarmly,\nEarly Letters\n\nYou are getting this because it is about your Early Letters account. We only send what you need to know.\n\nQuestions? Reply to this email. A person reads every one.\n\nHelp hello@earlyletters.com · Privacy https://earlyletters.com/privacy\n\nEarly Letters. Exactly as you said it.\n",
